OL,3,GNEWSAGrants available to make bus
OL,4,Atravel more accessible
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses, charities and community
OL,7,Fgroups are being invited to apply for
OL,8,Fgrants of up to #5,000 to help people
OL,9,Fwho face barriers to using a city's
OL,10,Fpublic transport.
OL,12,FPortsmouth City Council's easy travel
OL,13,Faccess fund aims to make bus travel
OL,14,Feasier for people facing health, social
OL,15,For financial difficulties.
OL,17,FThe money can be used to provide
OL,18,Ftickets, travel training and other
OL,19,Fschemes designed to help people use
OL,20,Fbuses more confidently and
OL,21,Findependently.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
