OL,3,GNEWSAGrants available to make bus
OL,4,Atravel more accessible
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Candlish, cabinet member for
OL,7,Ftransport, said: "Overall bus use in
OL,8,FPortsmouth is booming but everyone
OL,9,Fshould have the opportunity to travel
OL,10,Faround Portsmouth and access the
OL,11,Fservices, activities, and opportunities
OL,12,Four city has to offer."
